#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:42
msgid ""
"Classic SD 1.5 from RunwayML. ~4 GB, single file. Great for LoRAs and fast "
"iteration."
msgstr "来自 RunwayML 的经典 SD 1.5。约 4 GB，单文件。非常适合 LoRA 和快速迭代。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:53
msgid ""
"Stable Diffusion XL base 1.0 with fixed VAE. ~6.5 GB, native 1024x1024 "
"generation."
msgstr "Stable Diffusion XL base 1.0，采用修复版 VAE。约 6.5 GB，原生 1024x1024 生成。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:65
msgid "SD3 Medium with bundled CLIPs and T5XXL. ~5 GB, single file."
msgstr "SD3 Medium，内置 CLIP 和 T5XXL。约 5 GB，单文件。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:76
msgid ""
"SD3.5 Large with separate CLIP-L, CLIP-G and T5XXL text encoders. ~13 GB "
"total."
msgstr "SD3.5 Large，需单独的 CLIP-L、CLIP-G 和 T5XXL 文本编码器。总计约 13 GB。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:89
msgid ""
"FLUX.1-dev 12B Q8_0 (high quality). ~12 GB diffusion, ~12 GB T5XXL. Best on "
"16+ GB VRAM."
msgstr "FLUX.1-dev 12B Q8_0（高质量）。扩散模型约 12 GB，T5XXL 约 12 GB。16 GB 以上显存效果最佳。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:103
msgid ""
"FLUX.1-dev 12B Q4_0 (smaller). ~6.5 GB diffusion. Fits on 8 GB VRAM with "
"offload."
msgstr "FLUX.1-dev 12B Q4_0（更小）。扩散模型约 6.5 GB。借助卸载可放进 8 GB 显存。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:117
msgid ""
"FLUX.1-schnell 12B Q8_0, distilled for 4-step generation. Apache 2.0 "
"licensed."
msgstr "FLUX.1-schnell 12B Q8_0，经蒸馏实现 4 步生成。采用 Apache 2.0 许可证。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:131
msgid ""
"FLUX.2-dev with Mistral-Small-3.2 24B LLM text encoder. ~19 GB diffusion, "
"~14 GB LLM."
msgstr ""
"FLUX.2-dev，使用 Mistral-Small-3.2 24B LLM 文本编码器。扩散模型约 19 GB，LLM 约 14 GB。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:144
msgid ""
"FLUX.2-klein-4B with Qwen3-4B text encoder. ~2.5 GB diffusion, ~2.5 GB LLM. "
"Fits on 8 GB VRAM."
msgstr ""
"FLUX.2-klein-4B，使用 Qwen3-4B 文本编码器。扩散模型约 2.5 GB，LLM 约 2.5 GB。可放进 8 GB 显存。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:157
msgid ""
"FLUX.2-klein-9B with Qwen3-8B text encoder. ~5.5 GB diffusion, ~5 GB LLM. "
"Fits on 12 GB VRAM."
msgstr ""
"FLUX.2-klein-9B，使用 Qwen3-8B 文本编码器。扩散模型约 5.5 GB，LLM 约 5 GB。可放进 12 GB 显存。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:170
msgid ""
"FLUX.1-Kontext-dev image edit model. Requires a reference image. ~6.9 GB "
"diffusion Q4_K_M."
msgstr "FLUX.1-Kontext-dev 图像编辑模型。需要参考图像。扩散模型 Q4_K_M 约 6.9 GB。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:184
msgid ""
"Chroma unlocked v40 8.9B Q8_0. ~8.9 GB diffusion, ~9.5 GB T5XXL. Apache 2.0."
msgstr ""
"Chroma unlocked v40 8.9B Q8_0。扩散模型约 8.9 GB，T5XXL 约 9.5 GB。采用 Apache 2.0 许可。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:197
msgid ""
"Qwen Image with Qwen2.5-VL-7B text encoder. ~13 GB diffusion, ~4.5 GB LLM. "
"Strong text rendering."
msgstr "Qwen Image，使用 Qwen2.5-VL-7B 文本编码器。扩散模型约 13 GB，LLM 约 4.5 GB。文字渲染能力强。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:210
msgid ""
"Qwen Image Edit. Takes a reference image plus an instruction prompt. Shares "
"the Qwen Image VAE and LLM. Requires --diffusion-model and -r flags at "
"runtime."
msgstr ""
"Qwen Image Edit。接收参考图像加指令提示词。与 Qwen Image 共用 VAE 和 LLM。运行时需要 --diffusion-"
"model 和 -r 标志。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:223
msgid ""
"Qwen Image Edit 2509. Adds --llm_vision (vision projector) for stronger "
"instruction following. Needs an additional ~1 GB mmproj file."
msgstr ""
"Qwen Image Edit 2509。新增 --llm_vision（视觉投影器），指令遵循更强。需要额外约 1 GB 的 mmproj 文件。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:237
msgid ""
"Qwen Image Edit 2511. Uses a safetensors LLM and requires --qwen-image-zero-"
"cond-t (set automatically)."
msgstr ""
"Qwen Image Edit 2511。使用 safetensors 格式的 LLM，需要 --qwen-image-zero-"
"cond-t（会自动设置）。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:250
msgid ""
"Z-Image Turbo distilled 8-step model. ~3.9 GB diffusion, ~2.5 GB Qwen3-4B. "
"Fits on 8 GB VRAM."
msgstr "Z-Image Turbo 蒸馏 8 步模型。扩散模型约 3.9 GB，Qwen3-4B 约 2.5 GB。可放进 8 GB 显存。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:263
msgid ""
"LTX-2.3 video model with gemma-3-12b text encoder. ~10 GB diffusion, ~7 GB "
"LLM, ~5 GB VAE."
msgstr "LTX-2.3 视频模型，使用 gemma-3-12b 文本编码器。扩散模型约 10 GB，LLM 约 7 GB，VAE 约 5 GB。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:278
msgid ""
"Ovis-Image 7B text-to-image with Ovis 2.5 text encoder. ~4.2 GB diffusion, "
"~5 GB LLM."
msgstr "Ovis-Image 7B 文生图模型，使用 Ovis 2.5 文本编码器。扩散模型约 4.2 GB，LLM 约 5 GB。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:291
msgid ""
"Anima preview 3B Q4_K_M. ~1.4 GB diffusion, ~0.5 GB Qwen3-0.6B. Very "
"lightweight."
msgstr "Anima preview 3B Q4_K_M。扩散模型约 1.4 GB，Qwen3-0.6B 约 0.5 GB。非常轻量。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:304
msgid ""
"Qwen Image 2.1 with Qwen3-VL-8B. ~4.2 GB diffusion, ~5 GB LLM, dedicated 2.1"
" VAE (not interchangeable with Qwen Image 1.x)."
msgstr ""
"Qwen Image 2.1，使用 Qwen3-VL-8B。扩散模型约 4.2 GB，LLM 约 5 GB，配有专用 2.1 VAE（与 Qwen "
"Image 1.x 不通用）。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:317
msgid ""
"Qwen Image 2.1 instruction editing. Same diffusion and VAE as 2.1 t2i, plus "
"a Qwen3-VL-8B vision projector (--llm_vision)."
msgstr ""
"Qwen Image 2.1 指令编辑。扩散模型和 VAE 与 2.1 文生图相同，另需 Qwen3-VL-8B "
"视觉投影器（--llm_vision）。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:331
msgid ""
"Full (non-turbo) Z-Image with Qwen3-4B. ~5.1 GB diffusion, ~2.5 GB LLM. Use "
"CFG ~5; Turbo remains the faster 8-step option."
msgstr ""
"完整版（非 Turbo）Z-Image，使用 Qwen3-4B。扩散模型约 5.1 GB，LLM 约 2.5 GB。建议 CFG 约 5；Turbo "
"仍是速度更快的 8 步选择。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:344
msgid ""
"Pixel-space Chroma1-Radiance v0.4. ~10.4 GB diffusion plus T5XXL. No "
"separate VAE."
msgstr "像素空间的 Chroma1-Radiance v0.4。扩散模型约 10.4 GB，外加 T5XXL。无需单独的 VAE。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:356
msgid ""
"Krea2 Turbo with Wan 2.1 VAE and Qwen3-VL-4B. ~7.2 GB diffusion, ~2.5 GB "
"LLM."
msgstr "Krea2 Turbo，使用 Wan 2.1 VAE 和 Qwen3-VL-4B。扩散模型约 7.2 GB，LLM 约 2.5 GB。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:369
msgid ""
"ERNIE-Image Turbo with Flux.2 VAE and Ministral-3 3B. ~5 GB diffusion, ~2.2 "
"GB LLM. Fits on 8 GB VRAM with offload."
msgstr ""
"ERNIE-Image Turbo，使用 Flux.2 VAE 和 Ministral-3 3B。扩散模型约 5 GB，LLM 约 2.2 "
"GB。借助卸载可放进 8 GB 显存。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:382
msgid ""
"LongCat-Image with Flux VAE and Qwen2.5-VL-7B. ~3.7 GB diffusion. Put target"
" text in quotes for character-level rendering."
msgstr ""
"LongCat-Image，使用 Flux VAE 和 Qwen2.5-VL-7B。扩散模型约 3.7 GB。要逐字渲染文字，请将目标文本放入引号内。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:395
msgid ""
"LongCat-Image-Edit. Same VAE/LLM as LongCat t2i, plus a Qwen2.5-VL vision "
"projector."
msgstr "LongCat-Image-Edit。VAE/LLM 与 LongCat 文生图相同，另需 Qwen2.5-VL 视觉投影器。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:409
msgid ""
"Tiny MiniT2I transformer with Flan-T5-Large. Standalone safetensors, native "
"512x512. Very lightweight."
msgstr ""
"微型 MiniT2I transformer，搭配 Flan-T5-Large。独立 safetensors 文件，原生 512x512。非常轻量。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:422
msgid ""
"Bundled HiDream-O1-Image-Dev FP8 checkpoint (~8 GB). Load with -m; no "
"separate VAE or text encoder."
msgstr "内置 HiDream-O1-Image-Dev FP8 检查点（约 8 GB）。用 -m 加载；无需单独的 VAE 或文本编码器。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:434
msgid ""
"Boogu Image Turbo FP8 with Flux VAE and Qwen3-VL-8B. Standalone diffusion "
"safetensors (~10.3 GB)."
msgstr ""
"Boogu Image Turbo FP8，使用 Flux VAE 和 Qwen3-VL-8B。独立的扩散模型 safetensors（约 10.3 "
"GB）。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:448
msgid ""
"Boogu Image Edit FP8. Requires a reference image and the Qwen3-VL-8B vision "
"projector."
msgstr "Boogu Image Edit FP8。需要参考图像和 Qwen3-VL-8B 视觉投影器。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:463
msgid ""
"LLaDA-Image-Turbo 4-step model. ~7 GB diffusion, ~9.7 GB text encoder, "
"Flux.2-style VAE, connectors and an external tokenizer.json."
msgstr ""
"LLaDA-Image-Turbo 4 步模型。扩散模型约 7 GB，文本编码器约 9.7 GB，另有 Flux.2 风格的 "
"VAE、connectors 和外部 tokenizer.json。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:478
msgid ""
"LLaDA-Image-Turbo editing. Same transformer/LLM/VAE as Turbo t2i, but uses "
"the SigVQ edit connectors."
msgstr ""
"LLaDA-Image-Turbo 编辑版。transformer/LLM/VAE 与 Turbo 文生图相同，但使用 SigVQ 编辑 "
"connectors。"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:555
msgid "Stable Diffusion model to use"
msgstr "要使用的 Stable Diffusion 模型"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:567
msgid "Model Loading Mode"
msgstr "模型加载方式"

#: src/handlers/image_generator/stablediffusion_cpp_handler.py:569
msgid ""
"Choose which sd-cli argument loads the selected model. Automatic uses "
"--diffusion-model for GGUF files and -m for other formats. Standalone "
"diffusion models such as Anima safetensors require --diffusion-model."
msgstr ""
"选择用哪个 sd-cli 参数加载所选模型。自动模式对 GGUF 文件使用 --diffusion-model，对其他格式使用 -m。Anima "
"safetensors 等独立扩散模型需要 --diffusion-model。"

