#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:7
#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.desktop.in:3
msgid "Nyarch Assistant"
msgstr "Nyarch Assistant"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:9
msgid ""
"Your personal waifu always at your service to help you with your system!"
msgstr "专属猫娘伙伴随叫随到，帮你搞定系统里的各种事！"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:11
msgid "Your AI-Powered System Assistant"
msgstr "由 AI 驱动的系统小助手"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:15
msgid "Modes Support"
msgstr "模式支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:19
msgid "MCP Servers Catalog"
msgstr "MCP 服务器目录"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:23
msgid "Mini Window Mode"
msgstr "迷你窗口模式"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:27
msgid "Extensions and Skills Catalog"
msgstr "扩展与技能目录"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:31
msgid "Integrated Skill Editor"
msgstr "集成技能编辑器"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:35
msgid "Interactive Terminals"
msgstr "交互式终端"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:39
msgid "Citations"
msgstr "引用来源"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:53
msgid ""
"Workspaces: Divide chats into workspaces, and tie profiles to them. "
"Different workspaces can run in different windows"
msgstr "工作区：将对话划分到不同工作区，并为工作区绑定配置方案。不同工作区可在不同窗口中运行"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:54
msgid ""
"Subagents: You can now create subagents \"template\" to tackle specific "
"tasks. The main assistant can launch that subagent"
msgstr "子代理：现在可以创建子代理「模板」来应对特定任务，主助手可以启动该子代理"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:55
msgid ""
"New Long Term Memory: Added a new explorable long term memory that manages "
"memory across chats much better"
msgstr "全新长期记忆：新增可探索的长期记忆，能更好地管理跨对话的记忆"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:56
msgid ""
"Usage Tracking: You can now track how much you use Newelle and specific "
"models"
msgstr "用量追踪：现在可以追踪 Newelle 和特定模型的使用量"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:57
msgid ""
"Better search: You can now search for messages in conversations and options "
"in settings"
msgstr "更好的搜索：现在可以搜索对话中的消息和设置中的选项"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:58
msgid "Drafts: You can now create drafts of messages"
msgstr "草稿：现在可以创建消息草稿"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:60
msgid "Minor improvements:"
msgstr "其他改进："

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:62
msgid ""
"Newelle can now host an MCP server with Newelle's tools for third parties to"
" access"
msgstr "Newelle 现在可以托管一个 MCP 服务器，把 Newelle 的工具提供给第三方访问"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:63
msgid ""
"Improved profiles: They now have explicit inheritance systems and you can "
"transfer settings"
msgstr "配置方案改进：现在支持明确的继承体系，还可以转移设置"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:64
msgid "Added support to Qwen Image 2.1 and other image generation tools"
msgstr "新增对 Qwen Image 2.1 和其他图像生成工具的支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:65
msgid "Add a universal screenshot tool"
msgstr "新增通用截图工具"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:66
msgid ""
"When downloading local models, their size compatibility is estimated in the "
"model downloader"
msgstr "下载本地模型时，模型下载器会估算其体积兼容性"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:67
msgid "Improvements to the voice pill, still experimental"
msgstr "改进了语音胶囊，仍为实验性功能"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:68
msgid "Long Term Memories can now expose mini apps"
msgstr "长期记忆现在可以提供迷你应用"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:69
msgid "Performance improvements when deleting a message"
msgstr "提升了删除消息时的性能"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:70
msgid "You can now delete the chat you are in"
msgstr "现在可以删除当前所在的对话"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:77
msgid ""
"Add voice pill: launch Newelle with <code>newelle --voice</code> to show a "
"pill for fast voice interaction (Experimental)"
msgstr ""
"新增语音胶囊：使用 <code>newelle --voice</code> 启动 Newelle，即可显示用于快速语音交互的胶囊（实验性）"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:78
msgid "Fix no-argument tool calls failing when arguments is an empty string"
msgstr "修复 arguments 为空字符串时无参数工具调用失败的问题"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:79
msgid "Fix Anima image model not loading"
msgstr "修复 Anima 图像模型无法加载的问题"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:80
msgid "Allow adding MCP servers by pasting their JSON"
msgstr "支持通过粘贴 JSON 添加 MCP 服务器"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:81
msgid "Add the option to manually add scheduled tasks"
msgstr "新增手动添加计划任务的选项"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:82
msgid ""
"Fix generate_image tool failing on custom OpenAI-compatible servers due to a"
" hardcoded model name"
msgstr "修复因模型名称硬编码导致 generate_image 工具在自定义 OpenAI 兼容服务器上失败的问题"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:83
msgid ""
"Fix OpenAIEmbeddingHandler.get_embedding_size() returning the wrong "
"dimension, breaking FAISS index creation"
msgstr ""
"修复 OpenAIEmbeddingHandler.get_embedding_size() 返回错误维度、导致 FAISS 索引创建失败的问题"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:84
msgid "Add more statistics like caches and time to first token"
msgstr "新增更多统计项，例如缓存和首令牌时间"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:85
msgid "Fix building llama.cpp freezing when there is no internet connection"
msgstr "修复无网络连接时构建 llama.cpp 卡住的问题"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:86
msgid ""
"Add support for screen recording anywhere on Linux, instead of only on GNOME"
msgstr "支持在 Linux 上任意环境录制屏幕，不再局限于 GNOME"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:87
msgid ""
"Add support for video input / audio input / file input for OpenAI-compatible"
" providers"
msgstr "为 OpenAI 兼容服务提供商添加视频输入/音频输入/文件输入支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:88
msgid ""
"Add support for choosing whether to use RAG or CAG for OpenAI-compatible "
"providers"
msgstr "为 OpenAI 兼容服务提供商添加选择使用 RAG 还是 CAG 的支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:95
msgid "New Model Library UI and terminal management."
msgstr "全新的模型库界面和终端管理。"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:96
msgid "Improved builds for llama.cpp, whisper.cpp and stablediffusion.cpp."
msgstr "改进了 llama.cpp、whisper.cpp 和 stablediffusion.cpp 的构建。"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:97
msgid "Improved download manager and build cancellation."
msgstr "改进了下载管理器和构建取消功能。"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:98
msgid "Various bug fixes and stability improvements."
msgstr "修复多项问题，提升稳定性。"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:104
msgid ""
"Major update with improved agent capabilities, terminal integration, MCP "
"support and usability improvements."
msgstr "重大更新：增强了代理能力、终端集成和 MCP 支持，并改进了易用性。"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:107
msgid ""
"Improved terminal tool: Newelle can now manage persistent Terminal sessions "
"and interact with TUIs"
msgstr "终端工具改进：Newelle 现在可以管理持久终端会话并与 TUI 交互"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:108
msgid ""
"Added mode switching: users can create custom modes that quickly change "
"prompts, tools and skills, such as Planning mode"
msgstr "新增模式切换：用户可以创建自定义模式，快速切换提示词、工具和技能，例如规划模式"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:109
msgid ""
"Added a curated catalog of MCP servers that can be used to connect "
"applications to Newelle"
msgstr "新增精选的 MCP 服务器目录，可用于将应用连接到 Newelle"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:110
msgid "Added citations, allowing the LLM to state the source of information"
msgstr "新增引用来源功能，让 LLM 可以注明信息出处"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:111
msgid ""
"Added the ability to add LLM providers directly from the UI, including "
"OpenAI, Ollama and Anthropic-compatible providers"
msgstr "支持直接在界面中添加 LLM 服务提供商，包括 OpenAI、Ollama 和 Anthropic 兼容的服务提供商"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:112
msgid "Improved text generation animation"
msgstr "改进了文本生成动画"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:113
msgid "Added Compact Mode for tool calls and the input bar"
msgstr "为工具调用和输入栏新增紧凑模式"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:114
msgid ""
"Added the ability to download and explore new extensions and skills directly"
" in Newelle"
msgstr "支持直接在 Newelle 中下载和浏览新的扩展与技能"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:115
msgid ""
"Added a Skill editor to create and edit Newelle Skills directly in Newelle"
msgstr "新增技能编辑器，可直接在 Newelle 中创建和编辑 Newelle 技能"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:116
msgid ""
"Added a send_message tool for sending messages to interfaces, such as "
"Telegram"
msgstr "新增 send_message 工具，用于向 Telegram 等接口发送消息"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:117
msgid "Added new tools: sleep and switch_mode"
msgstr "新增工具：sleep 和 switch_mode"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:118
msgid "Agents can now read images using the read_image tool"
msgstr "代理现在可以使用 read_image 工具读取图像"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:119
msgid "Added the ability to delegate vision chats to a secondary LLM"
msgstr "支持将视觉对话委托给辅助 LLM"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:120
msgid "Added support for Mistral STT and TTS"
msgstr "新增对 Mistral STT 和 TTS 的支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:121
msgid "Added API key support for Ollama"
msgstr "为 Ollama 添加了 API 密钥支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:122
msgid "Improved the Anthropic LLM handler"
msgstr "改进了 Anthropic LLM 处理器"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:123
msgid ""
"Added the ability to set the maximum number of tool iterations in a chat"
msgstr "支持设置对话中工具迭代的最大次数"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:124
msgid "Fixed bugs with the OpenAI handler"
msgstr "修复了 OpenAI 处理器的问题"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:125
msgid "Added support for the OpenAI /responses endpoint"
msgstr "新增对 OpenAI /responses 端点的支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:126
msgid "Improved the Telegram interface"
msgstr "改进了 Telegram 接口"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:127
msgid "Improved the GUI-API interface"
msgstr "改进了 GUI-API 接口"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:128
msgid "Improved logging support in the OpenAI API interface"
msgstr "改进了 OpenAI API 接口的日志支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:129
msgid "Fixed bugs with LaTeX rendering and improved performance"
msgstr "修复了 LaTeX 渲染问题并提升了性能"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:130
msgid "Added an option to automatically expand thinking"
msgstr "新增自动展开思考的选项"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:131
msgid "Fixed thinking scrolling up while streaming"
msgstr "修复了流式传输时思考内容向上滚动的问题"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:132
msgid "Improved mini-window mode"
msgstr "改进了迷你窗口模式"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:133
msgid "Added CTRL+G to switch between normal and mini-window modes"
msgstr "新增 CTRL+G 在普通模式和迷你窗口模式之间切换"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:139
msgid "Bug fixes and stability improvements."
msgstr "修复问题并提升稳定性。"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:144
msgid "Added image generation support and various improvements."
msgstr "新增图像生成支持，并包含多项改进。"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:147
msgid "Added image generation support"
msgstr "新增图像生成支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:148
msgid ""
"Added support for stablediffusion.cpp, including model library and "
"installation/compilation options"
msgstr "新增对 stablediffusion.cpp 的支持，包括模型库以及安装/编译选项"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:149
msgid ""
"Added support for Pollinations, OpenAI and OpenRouter image generation "
"providers"
msgstr "新增对 Pollinations、OpenAI 和 OpenRouter 图像生成服务提供商的支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:150
msgid "Added image editing support"
msgstr "新增图像编辑支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:151
msgid "Redesigned chat interface"
msgstr "重新设计了对话界面"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:152
msgid "Added support for STDIO MCP servers in the Flatpak version"
msgstr "Flatpak 版本新增对 STDIO MCP 服务器的支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:153
msgid ""
"Improved lazy tool loading by automatically exposing tool schemas when "
"needed"
msgstr "改进了工具懒加载，会在需要时自动公开工具 schema"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:154
msgid "Improved MCP server error handling"
msgstr "改进了 MCP 服务器的错误处理"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:155
msgid "Various bug fixes and stability improvements"
msgstr "多项错误修复与稳定性改进"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:161
msgid "Bug fix"
msgstr "错误修复"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:166
msgid "Major update with new APIs, integrations and usability improvements."
msgstr "重大更新，包含全新 API、集成功能和易用性改进。"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:169
msgid "Added Interfaces for external applications to interact with Newelle"
msgstr "新增供外部应用与 Newelle 交互的接口"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:170
msgid "Added Telegram support"
msgstr "新增 Telegram 支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:171
msgid ""
"Added OpenAI compatible API with support for TTS, STT, LLM and Embeddings"
msgstr "新增兼容 OpenAI 的 API，支持 TTS、STT、LLM 和嵌入"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:172
msgid ""
"Third party OpenAI compatible interfaces can now control Newelle using the "
"v2 API"
msgstr "第三方兼容 OpenAI 的接口现在可以通过 v2 API 控制 Newelle"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:173
msgid "Added GUI API for third party interfaces"
msgstr "为第三方接口新增 GUI API"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:174
msgid "Added support for downloading pre-compiled llama.cpp binaries"
msgstr "新增对下载 llama.cpp 预编译二进制文件的支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:175
msgid "Improved command permissions and safety restrictions"
msgstr "改进了命令权限与安全限制"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:176
msgid "Added support for custom command rules and paths"
msgstr "新增对自定义命令规则和路径的支持"

#: data/moe.nyarchlinux.assistant.appdata.xml.in:177
